    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  Based on our planned route, we should be approaching the central town of South Chernobog.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Based on our planned route, we should be approaching the central town of South Chernobog."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  We'll arrive at the rendezvous point after crossing this park. Assuming no contingencies, Nearl and Team E4 should be waiting for us there.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "We'll arrive at the rendezvous point after crossing this park. Assuming no contingencies, Nearl and Team E4 should be waiting for us there."
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_013_riop\",name2=\"char_130_doberm_ex\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   But...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "But..."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   If Nearl was attacked... What would we do then?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "If Nearl was attacked... What would we do then?"
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   What if they wanted to alert us, but couldn't due to communications being jammed...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "What if they wanted to alert us, but couldn't due to communications being jammed..."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   How should we deal with that?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "How should we deal with that?"
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_013_riop\",name2=\"char_130_doberm_ex\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop",
        "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  ...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "..."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_002_amiya_1#7\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   We will go assess the situation.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "We will go assess the situation."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "raw": "[character(name=\"char_013_riop\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_013_riop"
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   ...Oh...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "...Oh..."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\",name2=\"char_013_riop\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]   Don't start speculating before seeing things with your own eyes.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "Don't start speculating before seeing things with your own eyes."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ace\"]   There's no point of letting paranoia get the better of you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ace",
        "content": "There's no point of letting paranoia get the better of you."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_014_riope\",name2=\"char_013_riop\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_014_riope",
        "name2": "char_013_riop",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"Guard\"]   I, I see...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Guard",
        "content": "I, I see..."
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_130_doberm_ex\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  Losing our communications has caused anxiety to spread through the ranks much faster than I imagined...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Losing our communications has caused anxiety to spread through the ranks much faster than I imagined..."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  Especially with this looming Catastrophe.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "Especially with this looming Catastrophe."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"Dobermann\"]  We have to pick up our pace.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Dobermann",
        "content": "We have to pick up our pace."
    },
